<title>FRANCE: Promodes 1996 sales rise 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Promodes 1996 sales rise 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					103,537 vs 100,575</p>
<p>	of which France			    66,540 vs  65,156</p>
<p>		   Abroad r			  36,997 vs  35,419</p>
<p>Note: Retailer Promodes said in a statement that sales rose 2.9 percent in 1996. During the final quarter, consolidated sales rose 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;In neutralising the effects of the sale of Promohypermarkt, of DIA in France and in Italy, and the taking control of Gruppo G, (1996 full-year) sales rose on a like-for-like basis by seven percent,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
